{"universe":"Orintanum","format":"rite.v1","rites":[{"id":"MA.orintanum.E7.assay.000226","name":"Vaulum","tier":7,"age":"VII","school":"fitech","era":"E7","spine":"II.R.18","text":"A mind-trap pulls a lone guardian through four false lands, each mirroring a past age of his own legend. A small pale child keeps whispering warnings that the lands are wrong.","steps":[{"step":"offer","item":"minecraft:echo_shard","count":3},{"step":"hunt","entity":"minecraft:warden","count":1,"radius":48},{"step":"stones","runes":["holly","hazel","birch","rowan","alder","willow","ash","hawthorn","oak"],"order_hidden":true},{"step":"hour","window":"dawn"},{"step":"feast","tag":"diaithirbosses:offering_feast"},{"step":"coop","fighters":3,"solo":"champion_token_per_absent"},{"step":"defend","seconds":105}]},{"id":"MA.orintanum.E7.assay.000328","name":"Ciallontia","tier":7,"age":"VII","school":"fitech","era":"E7","spine":"II.R.18","text":"A dark cosmic force that mirrors a radiant opposing current across the vast universe. It is mainly wielded by a tyrannical ruler of a distant realm.","steps":[{"step":"offer","item":"minecraft:ender_eye","count":7},{"step":"hunt","entity":"minecraft:enderman","count":4,"radius":48},{"step":"stones","runes":["willow","ash","hawthorn","oak","holly","hazel","birch","rowan","alder"],"order_hidden":true},{"step":"hour","window":"dawn"},{"step":"feast","tag":"diaithirbosses:offering_feast"},{"step":"coop","fighters":3,"solo":"champion_token_per_absent"},{"step":"defend","seconds":105}]},{"id":"MA.orintanum.E7.assay.000329","name":"Niasor","tier":7,"age":"VII","school":"fitech","era":"E7","spine":"II.R.18","text":"A cosmic life force runs through every growing thing across all realms, animating plants everywhere. It appears to beings of its nature as a shared dreamscape where many minds gather together.","steps":[{"step":"offer","item":"minecraft:netherite_scrap","count":3},{"step":"hunt","entity":"minecraft:enderman","count":4,"radius":48},{"step":"stones","rune